;;;;;; Martini lipid topology for di-C08:0 PE (DTPE), generated using:
; The Martini lipid itp generator version M3.l01  Args are: -alname DTPE -alhead 'E P' -allink 'G G' -altail 'cC cC'
; WARNING: Autogenerated and not all lipid headgroup and tail combinations have been tested;
;          used with care and see K.B. Pedersen et al. 2024 for guidance.
